# vmxbooter_defconfig -- kernel configuration for Composite guest images.
#
# Generated with `make savedefconfig` from the known-good .config, then edited:
#   * CONFIG_INITRAMFS_SOURCE removed -- the build sets it per recipe to an
#     absolute path (see mk/kernel.mk).
#   * CONFIG_DEVTMPFS enabled -- /init mounts devtmpfs to get /dev/console.
#     Note CONFIG_DEVTMPFS_MOUNT is deliberately NOT set: drivers/base/Kconfig
#     states it "does not affect initramfs based booting", which is all we do,
#     so it would be inert and misleading.
#
# This replaces a tracked 2982-line .config whose CC/AS/LD/PAHOLE version keys
# rewrote themselves on every machine.
# CONFIG_LOCALVERSION_AUTO is not set
# CONFIG_SWAP is not set
# CONFIG_CROSS_MEMORY_ATTACH is not set
